1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 23=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(You're not far from death yourself!)

4
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:19,040
You knew all along His Majesty would
choose a princess for the alliance.

5
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:20,600
Jinxuan's illness...

6
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,360
You caused it, didn't you?

7
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,560
Thank you, Director Li.

8
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:27,920
Your Highness.

9
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,800
Princess Jinxuan's fever won't break

10
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,720
because she ate foods
that aggravate her condition.

11
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,480
Physician Li, are you aware

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:36,960
that a few days ago,

13
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,840
His Majesty received envoys from Beijie?

14
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:40,080
He's already decided

15
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,200
to send a princess
for a marriage alliance?

16
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,040
A marriage alliance?

17
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:45,280
But both princesses are still so young.

18
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,360
How can they possibly marry?

19
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,320
Exactly.

20
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,040
They're just children.

21
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,520
A barren desert, leagues away,

22
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,480
in a foreign land.

23
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,440
Of the princesses sent for alliances,

24
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,280
how many ever survive?

25
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:57,520
Even the Empress Dowager's
Princess Duanjing

26
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,200
died of sorrow less than two years

27
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,240
after arriving in Beijie.

28
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,520
She died far from home.

29
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,840
Her remains were never brought back.

30
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:05,080
So...

31
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,960
I want you to poison her for me.

32
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,400
Only that way

33
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:12,800
can I save Jinxuan.

34
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,360
I can't just watch her

35
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:18,640
be sent off to such a miserable fate.

36
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,360
Your Highness.

37
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:23,080
The marriage alliance
is His Majesty's decree.

38
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:24,280
It's a matter of state.

39
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,320
No one can change it.

40
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:27,400
You're a man.

41
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:29,000
You don't know a woman's suffering.

42
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,120
Men can study and enter public service,

43
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,320
make a name for themselves.

44
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,640
The world is vast.

45
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,920
You can go wherever you please.

46
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:38,040
But women...

47
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:39,880
We are born without freedom.

48
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,480
Whom we marry, where we go,

49
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,920
whether we live well...

50
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,960
It's never ours to choose.

51
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:48,200
Even royal princesses,

52
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,680
for all their privilege,

53
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:51,960
aren't much better off.

54
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:53,560
Not to mention

55
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,080
these ordinary women born into poverty.

56
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,360
Never mind.

57
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,880
How could I expect you

58
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,640
to understand what women go through,

59
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,880
to truly feel our pain?

60
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:16,840
Your Highness.

61
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:17,880
I do understand.

62
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:19,920
I've practiced medicine for years.

63
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,200
I've seen so many people.

64
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,720
And here in the harem,

65
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:25,280
I've seen countless women
suffer terrible fates.

66
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,560
Pitiful,

67
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:27,840
and lamentable.

68
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,000
A physician's medicine

69
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,320
can be poison

70
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,480
when used improperly,

71
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:33,800
but a remedy

72
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,080
when used correctly.

73
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,400
The key is to adapt,

74
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,600
not to cling to rules.

75
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,240
If this can truly spare her

76
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,360
escape the marriage alliance,

77
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,440
then poison

78
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,080
is a life-saving cure.

79
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:46,840
Of two evils, choose the lesser.

80
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,200
I'm willing to set aside my principles

81
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:51,520
and poison the princess

82
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,200
to give her a way to live.

83
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,160
Chengyan.

84
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,400
Thank you.

85
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,440
You think I wouldn't know

86
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,560
you planted a spy on me?

87
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,360
You wanted to add fish and shrimp

88
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,440
to Jinxuan's food?

89
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:28,640
So I went ahead and
poisoned her for you.

90
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:30,360
How's that?

91
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,040
You went to all that trouble,

92
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,120
only to shoot yourself in the foot.

93
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,440
Take good care of Jinxuan.

94
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:40,320
Once Xihe has left,

95
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,600
I will

96
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,120
come and bring her back myself.

97
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,040
You wretch.

98
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,760
I won't let you succeed!

99
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,840
An imperial decree!

100
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:09,280
(Imperial Decree)
His Majesty decrees.

101
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:10,680
The Royal extends its grace,

102
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,200
beginning with its own kin.

103
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,760
Princess Xihe,

104
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,280
born of the Empress,

105
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,840
gentle by nature,

106
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,520
proper in conduct.

107
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,840
Her virtues grace the palace.

108
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:23,720
She is hereby titled Princess Yongjia,

109
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,160
granted golden seals and scrolls,

110
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,440
and sent to Beijie
for a marriage alliance.

111
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,880
She shall also receive
50,000 taels of gold

112
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,880
and 500 bolts of brocade.

113
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:36,560
May she humbly accept
this honored command

114
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,120
and enjoy His Majesty's favor forever.

115
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:39,600
So decreed.

116
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,080
I want to see His Majesty.

117
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,000
Mother!

118
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,360
- Mother, help me!
- Xihe!

119
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,080
- Let her go!
- I don't want to go!

120
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:51,800
Let go of my daughter!

121
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,720
- I don't want to be married off!
- Let go!

122
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,360
Let go! Who dares touch her?

123
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,440
Concubine Qi.

124
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,440
This is His Majesty's decree.

125
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,120
Princess Xihe must be taken away today.

126
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,280
Please, Your Highness,

127
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,200
don't make this difficult for me.

128
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,160
Let go.

129
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,080
Let go of my daughter!

130
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,240
- Take her away.
- Mother!

131
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,360
Let go!

132
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:12,360
- Xihe!
- Mother, help me!

133
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,840
I don't want to be married off!

134
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,880
Let her go...

135
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:16,720
Xihe!

136
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,400
- Mother, help me!
- Xihe...

137
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,360
Let her go!

138
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,840
Let go of my daughter...

139
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,280
- Mother, help me...
- Let go!

140
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,440
Xihe!

141
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,920
Xihe!

142
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,280
Let go of my daughter!

143
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,200
Xihe...

144
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:30,640
Mother, save me...

145
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:32,640
Save me!

146
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:33,800
Xihe!

147
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,040
- Xihe!
- Mother!

148
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,720
- Give my daughter back!
- Mother, help me...

149
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,600
- Xihe...
- Mother, help me!

150
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:40,560
I don't want to go!

151
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,320
Xihe!

152
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:42,440
- Xihe...
- Mother...

153
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,360
Mother!

154
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,280
Xihe!

155
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,920
My daughter...

156
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,480
Give my daughter back...

157
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,760
How does it feel to be torn
from your child?

158
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,480
Doesn't it...

159
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,960
cut you to the bone?

160
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,040
Fu Rong.

161
00:06:00,400 --> 00:06:01,640
You wretch!

162
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,400
I'll kill you!

163
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:05,960
Your child matters,

164
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,720
but other people's children don't?

165
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,640
You used poison to silence my daughter.

166
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,120
You harmed Concubine Rou's child.

167
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,560
You hide behind the late Empress's name,

168
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,080
never repenting,

169
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,120
arrogant to the end.

170
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,040
You've deceived His Majesty,

171
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:20,320
and time and again escaped punishment.

172
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,240
Justice lives in people's hearts.

173
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,120
His Majesty protects you,

174
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:27,160
so I'll use my own means

175
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,360
to punish you.

176
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,760
And get justice for

177
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,320
all those you've wronged.

178
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:37,920
Fu Rong.

179
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,720
I yield.

180
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,880
I'm no match for you.​​

181
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:46,320
But do you really think
you're so clever?

182
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:50,160
Do you really think
His Majesty can't see through you?

183
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,760
Do you think he's blind?

184
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,120
You schemed in secret

185
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,640
to thwart Jinxuan's marriage alliance.

186
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,720
You defied his will

187
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,600
and crossed a line.

188
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:02,040
The harem may not
meddle in state affairs.

189
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,080
Fu Rong.

190
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,880
I'm telling you,

191
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,240
you're not far from death yourself!

192
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,680
So what?

193
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,760
My conscience is clear.

194
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,680
Everything I've done

195
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,480
was to protect those I should protect.

196
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,440
Even if His Majesty punishes me,

197
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,440
I'll accept it willingly.

198
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:26,360
I'm taking Jinxuan back now.

199
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,640
You can just watch

200
00:07:28,880 --> 00:07:30,560
as Xihe goes off to marry,

201
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,160
while you and your daughter

202
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:34,520
are torn apart forever.

203
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:42,840
Fu Rong!

204
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,440
You went to such lengths

205
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,400
to protect Jinxuan.
Do you think she's innocent?

206
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:50,560
She's the one who caused
your daughter's death!

207
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:56,760
What did you say?

208
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,240
Haven't you been investigating

209
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:06,600
how Noble Consort Hui
killed your daughter?

210
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:08,760
Then let me tell you.

211
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,080
That night,

212
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:13,640
the one who caught Noble Consort Hui
with a man behind the rockery

213
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,560
was Jinxuan.

214
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,360
Did you hear me?

215
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:18,480
It was Jinxuan,

216
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,640
not your daughter!

217
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,040
What?

218
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,080
Fu Rong.

219
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:29,080
You thought Lingxi was killed
for catching Noble Consort Hui

220
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,600
having an affair with

221
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,240
Prince Su, didn't you?

222
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,800
Let me tell you the truth now.

223
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:37,160
That day,

224
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,040
the one who caught
Noble Consort Hui's secret

225
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,520
was never Lingxi.

226
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:43,480
It was Jinxuan.

227
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,560
Zhaoyi Shen knew that

228
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:48,280
if Noble Consort Hui

229
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:50,160
found out it was Jinxuan that night,

230
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,040
she would kill her.

231
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,600
So she had someone

232
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:56,160
lure your daughter to the rockery,

233
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,560
making Noble Consort Hui think
it was Lingxi.

234
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:01,360
and had Zhaoyi Shen kill her.

235
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,800
Didn't expect that, did you?

236
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,840
Your daughter

237
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:09,760
was nothing but a scapegoat for Jinxuan.

238
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,960
Impossible.

239
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:19,040
I don't believe it.

240
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,040
You don't?

241
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:24,320
That day, I scolded Yinshuang.

242
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,720
She went to the Imperial Garden
to clear her head

243
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:29,400
and witnessed the whole thing herself.

244
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,400
Well?

245
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,680
Do you hate her now?

246
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,640
Will you still protect Jinxuan

247
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,760
as if she were your own daughter?

248
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:43,920
How can you face your
dead daughter, Lingxi?

249
00:10:27,163 --> 00:10:31,803
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

250
00:10:32,173 --> 00:10:36,653
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

251
00:10:37,083 --> 00:10:41,363
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

252
00:10:41,803 --> 00:10:46,283
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

253
00:10:46,723 --> 00:10:51,043
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

254
00:10:51,623 --> 00:10:56,083
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

255
00:10:56,423 --> 00:11:00,883
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

256
00:11:01,303 --> 00:11:05,803
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

257
00:11:06,093 --> 00:11:10,563
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

258
00:11:11,143 --> 00:11:14,080
♪Let the stars and sea♪

259
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,480
(Changsheng Gate)

260
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:19,053
♪Wait for your return♪
